Ahmad Al-Nawaiseh has been in this field for more than nineteen years. He took his BA in Physical Education at Mutah University in 2008, spent years as a military fitness trainer, and finished a master's in sports training in 2022. He is an accredited training instructor at Mutah University, where coaches earn their certification from him, and a certified instructor of the IFBB Pro League and the Mr. Olympia Academy.

He also judges. He sits on international panels for the IFBB Pro League and the NPC, which means he spends part of every year deciding what finished work looks like at the highest level of the sport.

That is the part that shows up on this floor. He specified Theeb machine by machine and opened it in 2025, with thirty-two completed courses behind the decisions. He also owns Turbo Gym, in another governorate.
